> Using Date_rounding_mod

The caller's date rounding mode is not inherited by what it calls from a
module: an ambiguous computation in the callee is still an error.

```catala
declaration scope CallsScope:
  output r content date

scope CallsScope:
  date round up
  definition r equals
    (output of Date_rounding_mod.NoRounding with { -- d: |2024-01-31| }).r

declaration scope CallsFunction:
  output r content date

scope CallsFunction:
  date round up
  definition r equals Date_rounding_mod.add_one_month of |2024-01-31|
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope CallsScope
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: ambiguous date computation with no rounding mode
│  specified.
│
├─➤ tests/modules/good/date_rounding_mod.catala_en:9.10-11:
│   │
│ 9 │   output r content date
│   │          ‾
└─
#return code 123#
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope CallsFunction
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: ambiguous date computation with no rounding mode
│  specified.
│
├─➤ tests/modules/good/date_rounding_mod.catala_en:17.10-21:
│    │
│ 17 │   equals d + 1 month
│    │          ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
└─
#return code 123#
```
